Digital Sidekick
This project is a web application that asks a person what their to-do list is today, breaks it down into smaller, specifc tasks and tracks their progress with a progress bar that gives food to our digital sidekick once full.

Why I built this project: I wanted to make the daily grind of life into a fun game that psychologically motivates users to complete their to-do lists.

Purpose: To get experience using Node.js, React and implement Gemini's API . The About me contains a detailed step by step tutorial of how the web application was built.

Digital Sidekick is built with: 
React - Front End: User inputs, XP progress bar, avatar
Node.js - Backend: Recieves input and communicatees with gemini
Gemini API - generates personalized 


