To add interactivity (state and event handlers):
-"use client"

This allows us to use hooks like useState, useEffect, etc:
-import { useState } from "react";

State variables in function Home():
-const [goal, setGoal] = useState("");
-const [activeTask, setActiveTask] = useState("");
-const [aiMessage, setAiMessage] = useState("");
