once we click button, activeGoal updates and displaying our goal on the page


Gemini API integeration:

React frontend -> Next.js API route -> Gemini API

Data flow
User clicks button - execute handleStart()
fetch('/api/') - Browser sends GET request to Next.js backend
Backend calls gemini - AI generates message
React updates states - setAiMessage() called
Message appear - JSX diplays ai response

